     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p>Hi,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve been tasked with producing a plot that uses polar coordinates to visualise risk values.</div><div><br></div><div>The chart is divided into four quadrants, with each quadrant having a representation of Low, Medium, and High risks. I want the y scale to be Low/Medium/High and the angle to represent the proportion of all risks at each level.</div><div><br></div><div>A picture is worth a thousand words:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">DATA </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Quadrant</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;First&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Second&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Third&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Fourth&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> each </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levels </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;First&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Second&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Third&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Fourth&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                   X </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">11</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">13</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">17</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">19</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">21</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">23</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Risk</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Low&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Medium&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;High&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> times </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levels </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Low&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Medium&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;High&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Count</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DATA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Risk</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_bar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;identity&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_x_continuous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">labels </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DATA$Quadrant</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  coord_polar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">theta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>This produces:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-J_qRJergAU4/VK0eY_8wrEI/AAAAAAAACKo/v9BfKUWkllQ/s1600/Rplot01.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-J_qRJergAU4/VK0eY_8wrEI/AAAAAAAACKo/v9BfKUWkllQ/s1600/Rplot01.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792369793009000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jrHoe-SrAwoBDtq3xkY83\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-J_qRJergAU4/VK0eY_8wrEI/AAAAAAAACKo/v9BfKUWkllQ/s1600/Rplot01.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><br></div><div>What is wrong with this plot is that the bars all have the same angle. I want the angle subtended by the bar to represent Count (which I have converted to a proportion for simplicity).</div><div>In order to achieve this I would need to use theta = &quot;y&quot; and set the y aesthetic to come from Count, but this would completely change the axes so that I would lose my quadrants!</div><div><br></div><div>Any advice appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m thinking that I would need to produce a number of plots independently and then overlay them on top of each other...</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
